      "message": "[warning] Line 76: 🟡 `isListSelected()` calls `listConversations()`, which calls `ContactAdapter.getContactTagConversations(list)` each time the binding reevaluates. Because each chip delegate binds `selected` to this, rendering/updating N chips can trigger N full contact scans repeatedly. Cache per-list conversations (or expose a precomputed model from C++) and have `isListSelected()` read from that cache.",
